formula:
  title: "Lexical Analysis & Reading Speed Formulas"
  expression: "Word Count = Total Unicode Word Tokens (\\p{L}\\p{N}+)  |  Reading Time = Words / 225 wpm"
  explanation: "Words are tokenized by matching contiguous sequences of Unicode letters and numbers, properly recognizing contractions and multi-script characters. Estimated silent reading time applies the peer-reviewed cognitive benchmark of 225 words per minute (Brysbaert 2019 meta-analysis)."
workedExamples:
