      - "Tokenize accented words and numbers: ['Café', 'au', 'lait', 'costs', '4', '50', 'in', 'Paris'] = 8 words"
      - "Count Unicode code points (emoji counted as 1 glyph): 36 characters"
      - "Count characters without whitespace: 29 characters"
    result: "8 words | 36 characters (29 no spaces) | 1 sentence | 2 sec reading time"
  - title: "Long Form Essay Timing (450 Words)"
